---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import '../styles/article.css';
---
<Layout title="阅读空间" active="articles" article>
  <div id="reader-loading" class="shell reader-loading" role="status"><span class="eyebrow">OPENING YOUR NOTE</span><h1>让文字，慢慢展开。</h1><p>正在读取已发布的文档…</p></div>
  <section id="reader-error" class="shell reader-error empty-state" hidden><Icon name="book" size={34}/><h1>这篇文档暂时无法打开</h1><p id="reader-error-message">文档可能已撤回发布，或连接暂时不可用。</p><div class="empty-writing-actions"><button class="button button-primary" id="reader-retry">重新读取</button><a class="button" href="/articles/">返回文章</a></div></section>
  <div class="reading-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="阅读进度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0"><span id="reading-progress-bar"></span></div>
  <div class="shell article-shell" id="live-reader" data-reading-article="" hidden>
    <div class="article-breadcrumb"><a href="/articles/" id="back-to-articles"><Icon name="back" size={16}/> 返回文章</a><span><span id="live-category">文章</span><i>/</i><span>阅读空间</span></span></div>
    <script is:inline>try { const previous=sessionStorage.getItem('asher-return'); if(previous && /^\/(articles|library)\/(\?[^#]*)?$/.test(previous)) document.getElementById('back-to-articles').setAttribute('href',previous); } catch {}</script>
    <header class="article-heading"><div class="article-labels"><span class="mono">FIELD NOTES</span><a id="live-edit" class="quiet-link mint" href="/manage/">编辑文档 <Icon name="northeast" size={13}/></a></div><h1 id="live-title"></h1><p id="live-description"></p><div class="article-meta"><span class="author-avatar">a</span><strong>asher</strong><span class="meta-divider"></span><time id="live-date"></time><span><Icon name="clock" size={14}/><span id="live-minutes"></span> 分钟阅读</span></div><div class="tag-row" id="live-tags"></div></header>
    <div class="reader-layout"><aside class="toc-sidebar"><span class="eyebrow">ON THIS PAGE</span><h2>在这篇文章里</h2><nav aria-label="文章目录" id="live-toc"></nav><div class="toc-progress"><span>阅读进度</span><strong id="reading-percent">0%</strong></div><p class="sidebar-note">慢慢读，让想法停留一会儿。</p></aside><div class="reader-main"><div class="reader-toolbar"><div><button class="reader-tool" id="live-bookmark" data-bookmark="" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="bookmark" size={17}/><span data-bookmark-label>收藏</span></button><button class="reader-tool" id="mark-read" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="check" size={18}/><span>标为已读</span></button></div><button class="reader-tool" id="focus-toggle" aria-pressed="false"><Icon name="focus" size={17}/><span>专注阅读</span><kbd>F</kbd></button></div><details class="mobile-toc"><summary>文章目录 <span>＋</span></summary><nav aria-label="移动端文章目录" id="live-mobile-toc"></nav></details><article class="prose" id="article-body"></article><div class="article-end"><span>— END OF NOTE —</span><p>读到这里，有没有一个想法值得留下？</p><span class="local-note">阅读状态仅保存于此浏览器，不同设备不会同步。</span></div><a class="next-article" href="/articles/"><div><span class="eyebrow">KEEP EXPLORING</span><h2>回到知识花园，继续探索</h2></div><Icon name="arrow" size={24}/></a></div></div>
  </div>
  <button id="exit-focus" class="button" hidden><Icon name="focus" size={17}/> 退出专注 <kbd>Esc</kbd></button>
  <script>import '../scripts/live-reader';</script>
</Layout>
